  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Project is to increase the income of RWGP and that of the smallholder cassava producing farmers. The fund will enable RWGP to increase the production, processing, and marketing of the processed gari products to increase sales and revenues.</narrative>
